              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Leonda58"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Very tasty recipe and easy to prepare. The sauce was a bit runny but my daughter made that part of the recipe so I'm not certain she got the portions exactly right. A definite keeper!!"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Pamela"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I loved it. They were so tender and juicy. Loved the sauce. My husband thought they were amazing. Wish I had taken a picture. I only use 1/2 cup of milk in sauce next time I’m gonna add less so it will be a little thicker.",
            "datePublished": "2025-11-01T01:21:43.073Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "2"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "me"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this recipe, but was very disapointed. The sauce was very runny, and I tried to thicken it up a bit with some corn starch, but it just ran off my pork chops and made a plate of soup. The sauce was tasty, but I wish it was thicker.",
            "datePublished": "2010-03-03T14:00:10.967Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "gkar2004"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I really enjoyed the sauce, but as others have said it needs to be thicker. My brother even likes this, and he doesn't try ANYTHING",
            "datePublished": "2009-09-11T16:55:21.290Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Tere"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I changed things, because I didn't have everything -- most especially white corn syrup. I used dark instead, because we love pecan pie -- and this tasted so heavenly. Even future SIL, who overcooks pork to the point of burning, liked this. I would have LOVED this with mashed potatoes, but was just too tired to peel them. We had mac &amp; cheese &amp; broccoli casserole instead. This was so good. Wait, I said that already!",
            "datePublished": "2009-08-12T03:32:17.720Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "KIMAR"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Sauce tasted good but was too runny, needs to be thickened with a bit of cornstarch. Hubby loved the sauce but thought it was too sweet and would be better as a dessert topping over a slice of cake, but I enjoyed it with the pork chops.",
